# An indented header is a leak origin.
-- input.cnf --
  [mydumper]
threads=4
-- diagnostics --
1:1-1:13 info MDL112[bracket-leak-risk] line contains `[` after other text: an empty line placed right after line 1 would make mydumper's pre-processor produce `= 1`, which GLib rejects
  = Adding an empty line after line 1 would make mydumper ignore the entire file.
